[2026-04-09 20:05:17] RicBit: o music player do zanac é muito superior ao do antartic, tem uma linguagem propria:

Bytes 0x80–0xDE: command dispatch (handler table at 4F6Ch):
0x80 lo hi — unconditional jump to address
0x81 lo hi — conditional loop (decrement ix+0Fh; jump if non-zero)
0x82 — end of track (deactivate channel)
0x84 N — set arpeggio type (ix+2 = N)
0x85 N — set note transpose offset (ix+3)
0x86 N — adjust volume (ix+1) by signed delta N
0x87 N — play track N (PLAY_MUSIC_SAFE)
0x88 N — set loop counter (ix+0Fh = N)
0x8A lo hi — portamento table lookup at address lo/hi
0x8B N M — enable vibrato (period=N, depth=M)
0x8C N M — configure portamento
